  "citation": "Johnson K M; Schneider B; Mintrop L; Wallace D W R (1996): CO2, Hydrographic, and Chemical Data Obtained During R/V Meteor Cruise 18/1 in the North Atlantic Ocean (WOCE Section A1E). CDIAC. Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/OTG.NDP056",
